1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,100
Assalamu alaikum, Brother Yusuf.

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,640
Thank you for accepting our invitation today.

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:05,120
Thank you.

4
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,900
So tell us, at your own pace,
how did you first come to the faith?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,400
Well, you know,

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,980
I was sixteen, and my mother sent me
to a Christian boarding school.

7
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,000
I went

8
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,500
because I had no choice in it.

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,340
And one day a man stopped me in the street
and he recited this verse.

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,980
اقرَأْ بِاسْمِ رَبِّكَ

11
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,600
Forty-five million people
heard that recitation that year.

12
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,200
And that changed everything.
